This package bundles the Geist typeface under `test/fonts/`, used only to make
golden tests deterministic. Geist is (c) Vercel, Inc. and is licensed under the
SIL Open Font License 1.1. Its full licence text is at
`test/fonts/OFL.txt`.

Cairn UI is an independent implementation. It contains no code from shadcn/ui
or Radix UI; see the "Credit" section of README.md.
